# MiniMax-Text-01 (MiniMax, 2025): 456B parameters, 45.9B of them active a token,
# trained on contexts of 1M tokens. Seven lightning attention layers, linear attention
# with a fixed decay per head, run for every softmax attention layer, 80 layers in all,
# and every layer's FFN is an MoE of 32 experts, the top 2 a token by a softmax router,
# none shared. The lightning layers' decays weaken with depth, counted over all 80
# layers. RoPE turns the first half of each head's dims, as MiniMax's own code does
# (transformers' port turns all of them).
#
# The residual is DeepNorm's, after the norms: each sublayer f normalizes the stream to
# h and gives alpha * h + f(h), with alpha = (2 * 80) ** (1/4). MiniMax-VL-01 is this
# model with a vision encoder, which is not described here.
d_model    = 6144
vocab_size = 200064
alpha      = 3.5565588200778455

norm      = rmsnorm(eps=1e-5)
lightning = lightning(num_heads=64, head_dim=128)
attn      = gqa(num_heads=64, num_kv_heads=8, head_dim=128,
                rope=rope(base=10000000, fraction=0.5))
experts   = moe(num_experts=32, top_k=2, aux_loss_coef=1e-3,
                expert=gated_mlp(intermediate_size=9216, activation=swish))

layer(mixer) = norm (_ * alpha + mixer) norm (_ * alpha + experts)
L = layer(lightning)
A = layer(attn)

model = embed "LLLLLLLA"^10 norm head
